Common Type ProgramParticipation
    documentation 'Programs the student is participating in or receiving services from.
    enumeration ProgramType
        documentation 'The type of program.
        is part of identity
    descriptor ProgramCharacteristic
        documentation 'Reflects important characteristics of the Program, such as categories or 
        'particular indications.
        is optional collection
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The date the Student was associated with the Program or service.
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The date the Program participation ended.
        is optional
    string DesignatedBy
        documentation 'The person, organization, or department that designated the program association.
        is optional
        min length 1
        max length 60

